  "body": "prev_content field is totally pruned by the server on redacted event.\n\nThe server must keep 'membership' for this sub dict (and prune only displayname, avatar_url...). Like it does for content dict.\n\nPresently when the user redacts a membership event related to an avatar change or a display name change, the resulting redacted event is not relevant.\nIt looks like a simple join...\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-724)\n\n(Reported by @giomfo)",
